# Standalone Next.js workspace

This folder is the product. It is **not** the openMF Angular web-app.

- Follow `AGENTS.md` in this folder only.
- Ignore parent `web-app/AGENTS.md`, `skills/SKILL.md`, Jira `WEB-*`, Angular Material, lodash/moment, ngx-translate, and `proxy.conf.js`.
- Angular is a frozen inventory (`docs/parity/FROZEN.md`). New screens are Fineract-first.
- Prefer opening `mifos-web-next.code-workspace` so parent Angular rules never load.
